(Linux Security: Largest Linux bus attack surface: /dev/i2c-1 \(i2c group\) is shared with DS2482-100 \(and any HAT) Tj
T* (EEPROM/RTC\). Any process with i2c group access can sniff, spoof, or clock-stretch DoS all 1-Wire and Pt1000 readings at) Tj
T* (once.) Tj
ET
